# Recycle Bin used on file shares
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# Windows Installer files
*.cab
*.msi
*.msix
*.msm
*.msp
# ...except the MSIX package's documentation, which is named README.msix to sit alongside
# packaging/rpm/README.rpm and packaging/deb/debian/README.Debian. `*.msix` above is meant to
# catch built packages, and it catches this by accident: without the negation the file is
# invisible to `git status`, so it is never committed and later edits to it are silent. The
# negation is here rather than the file being renamed because the .rpm and .Debian READMEs set
# the convention and one file spelled differently is worse than one line here.
!packaging/msix/README.msix

# Windows shortcuts
*.lnk

